<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">,</span></font></div><div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I hope all is well with you.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I would like to thank you for expressing interest in hosting a blood drive through the American Red Cross Leaders Save Lives program. I have gone over the information you submitted and I would like to meet with you to learn more about you and show you how we can work together to help patients in our community by ensuring there is always blood available when they need it. Leaders Save Lives is a great opportunity for students and I look forward to telling you more about this program.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">It takes a special person to be a Red Cross blood drive partner. It takes dedication, passion and the ability to organize and motivate others effectively. But, you won’t be alone. I will assist you in every way possible to help ensure you have the tools and information you need to make the partnership a success.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Let’s schedule some time to chat about next steps. &nbsp;Is there a time that works best for you?&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Kind regards,&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>